  "title": "Easy Pizza in a Pinch",
  "description": "Get all the flavor of pizza – without the hassle of making or buying pizza dough. You can split the buns in half along the fold to make appetizer-size portions, or you can leave the buns whole for mini-pizzas.",
  "authors": [
    "Ball Park Buns"
  ],
